{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12347","headline":"寇中送张司马归洛 · 钱起","name":"寇中送张司马归洛","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"戎狄寇周日，衣冠适洛年。\n客亭新驿骑，归路旧人烟。\n吾道将东矣，秋风更飒然。\n云愁百战地，树隔两乡天。\n旅思蓬飘陌，惊魂雁怯弦。\n今朝一尊酒，莫惜醉离筵。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12347.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12347","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}